===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmq-osw|fi}} {{term|floghdraki||flying snake|lang=gmq-osw}} > {{term||lohikäärme|salmon snake}}.

===Noun===
{{infl|fi|noun}}

# A [[dragon]].
# A [[wyvern]].

====Declension====
{{fi-decl-hame|lohikäärm|||ä}}

====Usage notes====
* Most Finns don't make a difference between a "wyvern" (''[[traakki]]'') and "dragon" ('''''lohikäärme'''''), and would use ''lohikäärme'' to refer to both.

